msgstr ""
"Den installerade YPerf-sidcachekomponenten ingår inte i den granskade "
"kompatibilitetskedjan."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The legacy advanced-cache.php is unexpectedly large, so YPerf refused "
"automatic cleanup."
msgstr ""
"Den äldre advanced-cache.php är oväntat stor, så YPerf nekade automatisk "
"rensning."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The legacy advanced-cache.php no longer has high-confidence W3 Total Cache "
