msgstr ""
"Den äldre advanced-cache.php kan inte längre med hög säkerhet kopplas till "
"W3 Total Cache."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The legacy drop-in could not be captured safely, so nothing was removed."
msgstr "Den äldre drop-in-filen kunde inte sparas säkert, så ingenting togs bort."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
